This parameter is required.', example='null'),
      revisionId?: string(name='revisionId', description='Required and always returned. An opaque business ID generated by the server. Ownership is validated, and arbitrary paths are not accepted. Constraints: {"minLength":1,"maxLength":128,"pattern":"^[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9_-]{0,127}$"}.

This parameter is required.', example='example_value'),
      score?: double(name='score', description='Required and always returned. A finite numerical value used for unified ranking. For hybrid, it is the relevance of the existing Dealer.rerank. For rerank, it is the text and model hybrid relevance of the existing Dealer.rerank_by_model, along semanticWeight and rank features, and is not a relevance probability. minScore is applied according to the existing unified scoring rules. Can be null for non-ranked factual evidence. Null is allowed and can be omitted.

This parameter is required.', example='0.62'),
      sectionId?: string(name='sectionId', description='Required and always returned. Null is allowed. The semantics of null values follow the field description. Null is allowed and can be omitted. Constraints: {"minLength":1,"maxLength":128,"pattern":"^[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9_-]{0,127}$"}.

